agentssl-can-mle-agents-leverage-unlabeled-data-0-0eeb85033b/","observation_id":"obs_0eeb85033b17e767df2baf29952590b87a1d0a37fafcf55314bf3032800cc91f","published_at":"2026-11-12T18:59:06Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"AgentSSL 研究 MLE 智能体在标注数据有限、未标注数据丰富时，能否自动组合并改进半监督学习方案。实验显示其在多数设置中超过人工基线，但程序选择仍会造成明显性能下降，并配套提出 ProgramSelectBench 基准。","title":"AgentSSL: Can MLE Agents Leverage Unlabeled Data?"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_75652dc861592c234e2fae4d15983948199915ef11c45d74b7e69306b21913aa","internal_url":"/posts/20261113-blogs_podcasts-optimizing-cost-per-task-and-proving-agent-roi-on--0-409a77b0b1/","observation_id":"obs_409a77b0b17a5148c50fa2d34fd8e289467f415901180490ea46c922f91886bd","published_at":"2026-11-12T18:43:19Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这套方法不再只看模型的 token 单价，而是按完整任务核算成本，并纳入分词效率、输出冗长度、代理循环次数和推理开销。它还通过人工基线、对照实验和五维评分卡，衡量智能体相对人工的表现与投资回报。","title":"Optimizing cost per task and proving agent ROI on Amazon Bedrock"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_334f59cf098e7f637657ae0b8e4f421c7eb680e9141e248df31f58dce8db47f4","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-blogs_podcasts-build-autonomous-ai-agents-with-amazon-bedrock-and-0-df6566d4fc/","observation_id":"obs_df6566d4fc91840890def19461933475d9c7a30723709bdf51469ad99565d346","published_at":"2026-11-12T01:18:23Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇面向 Java 团队的实战指南，介绍如何结合 Spring AI 与 Amazon Bedrock 构建可规划任务、调用工具并保留上下文的自主 AI 智能体。示例涵盖单智能体旅行助手和多智能体文档处理系统。","title":"Build autonomous AI agents with Amazon Bedrock and Spring AI"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_95cecb8305083349bfbcf3c8cc41a86f82493018d67030f9a80456f39f7daaff","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-hacker_news-united-airlines-bans-ai-agents-from-booking-flight-4-1df6a00742/","observation_id":"obs_1df6a00742e99b5a005c0a78a421a5b6942e095ec0450cf2125be3f75497863a","published_at":"2026-11-11T21:24:35Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"United Airlines bans AI agents from booking flights on behalf of travelers"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_41d3f459fdf663c57644e0e2751ead5861c390fbdd58b9793d32be7cc3125a0a","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-blogs_podcasts-the-attendees-guide-to-the-aws-reinvent-2026-aiml--0-e3fb265c4a/","observation_id":"obs_e3fb265c4a7f0c03e332381c674e35ece02aac3c1eec6df11ee65ed9b8e8bec6","published_at":"2026-11-11T21:05:59Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一份面向 AWS re:Invent 2026 AI/ML 专题的参会指南，介绍不同会话形式，并按 AI 芯片、模型训练与推理、智能体开发及管理等层级整理相关学习内容。内容还梳理了 AWS 从基础设施到智能体解决方案的 AI 技术栈。","title":"The attendee’s guide to the AWS re:Invent 2026 AI/ML track"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_ef45433b032bc579e197be1c644e0ea3e441835116fed8a0b8d4f1a1949fee7e","internal_url":"/posts/20261111-blogs_podcasts-the-agent-evaluation-playbook-built-in-deepeval-an-0-6d77a575f5/","observation_id":"obs_6d77a575f579de9bddf060a1269b34c406ecd2d2de042436b64417f39ef25e85","published_at":"2026-11-10T22:35:03Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇关于智能体评估实践的技术文章，介绍如何以业务目标为起点，将成功标准拆解为可观察行为，再映射到轨迹级或会话级评估器。文章重点讲解 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations 中内置评估器、DeepEval 和 AutoEval 的用途及组合方式。","title":"The agent evaluation playbook: Built-in, DeepEval, and AutoEval on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Evaluations"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_8b8c2e498a2724f40dce556760995e3b489348c4cb21300d916064d4d0ecdf46","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-arxiv-contrastive-discovery-open-ended-scientific-discov-1-0ada6edaa8/","observation_id":"obs_0ada6edaa8802c6af289894ab967fcf35b0a0535c053bc2fcc11ff5fc424d2a9","published_at":"2026-11-10T18:58:43Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这项研究提出“对比式发现”：让智能体同时评估一组相互排斥、覆盖完整备选方案的科学解释，并根据实验后各解释的信念变化判断问题是否解决。","title":"Contrastive Discovery: Open-Ended Scientific Discovery over Competing Explanations"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_1c1d3cbb4c57dec1c8416b056f3b0531555a5b726d5fb643b6ac574b7d881ec2","internal_url":"/posts/20261113-arxiv-pyrite-building-and-benchmarking-protein-ligand-po-1-57d7d2f6b4/","observation_id":"obs_57d7d2f6b4aa20be2834015865dea887cbf8be89f9724b5395fb34f3c536100c","published_at":"2026-11-10T18:56:32Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"Pyrite 是蛋白质—配体结合姿态排序基准，包含 1,500 组姿态对。它结合结构化分子表示 PyriteRep，以及直接比较姿态的 PyriteReasoner 和生成特征代码的 PyriteFeaturizer 两类 LLM 智能体。","title":"Pyrite: Building and Benchmarking Protein-Ligand Pose Ranking Agents"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_dcd418c4245c96e85979a8bd046bc6d84a79bcb9838aa3be450f475c85019a07","internal_url":"/posts/20261111-hacker_news-show-hn-get-your-coding-agent-off-2019-javascript--8-a4978faa7e/","observation_id":"obs_a4978faa7e166cdb12b818c5397aad221fe34e5d74e2dc0c479fe886ef474c07","published_at":"2026-11-10T18:01:15Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"Show HN: Get your coding agent off ~2019 JavaScript, onto modern web primitives"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_a81b4186e38610f6dd20d17326190d0db192d3abb1f5a37fc673a08f67564f52","internal_url":"/posts/20261110-blogs_podcasts-professional-work-deserves-professional-tools-meet-0-a393a08732/","observation_id":"obs_a393a08732124dc48b79299a0700e8da6df3fce9b04c9f5627076cb3f66fb7ba","published_at":"2026-11-09T18:43:30Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"AWS Quick 是面向企业知识工作者的 AI 工作空间，可让 AI 智能体跨企业现有数据与应用进行研究、分析和执行操作。此次内容还介绍了其品牌更名、企业级安全治理能力及面向美国和英国知识工作者的推广活动。","title":"Professional work deserves professional tools. Meet AWS Quick."},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_b192c524a4542db04537d2b0d9fb88f43d605572fa6606a05a35b63f4dad4c81","internal_url":"/posts/20261109-blogs_podcasts-how-stanford-teaches-ai-native-engineering-mihail--0-2c00110bd6/","observation_id":"obs_2c00110bd6231e5944e32b7c2b10255f3721d5597aa09b393fd97b57c877a8f7","published_at":"2026-11-08T21:41:44Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一段对 Stanford 课程教师、Monaco AI 负责人 Mihail Eric 的访谈，讨论 AI 时代软件工程师需要学习什么，以及编码代理如何进入课程、代码审查、故障排查和软件交付流程。","title":"How Stanford Teaches AI-Native Engineering — Mihail Eric, Monaco"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_2179cf8fb1a2a3ea2053d5d1ff8f5d40121261e096cf9d17b6f1ae955d426605","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-hacker_news-i-gave-an-agent-a-lakehouse-and-control-of-my-gard-13-70a92d6577/","observation_id":"obs_70a92d6577eb2908209f022739e6be155e93a027762b270f5d2e1ca720ae1ce1","published_at":"2026-11-08T17:19:06Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"I gave an agent a lakehouse and control of my garden"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_c9fb3507bfc43b128470b7c8388c917efade0c9148f79d6d7ab8af31e19edbfd","internal_url":"/posts/20261107-hacker_news-the-components-of-agent-memory-8-f0247d2be6/","observation_id":"obs_f0247d2be6d23fda27989bba50a71943168bf8e5f68168df2bbd40b50bab75f3","published_at":"2026-11-07T06:39:04Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"The Components of Agent Memory"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_046948033f609193161b1cdd8dc7915cb3fd94f413db4c18afa644c97a4cb051","internal_url":"/posts/20261110-arxiv-sampling-is-not-curiosity-why-llm-agents-should-in-0-9bf8ee3cf7/","observation_id":"obs_9bf8ee3cf74288a31c86d214fac38cb139d30b2db159eecd0521043bf3466ca5","published_at":"2026-11-07T06:02:37Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这篇论文区分了 LLM 智能体的随机探索与真正的“好奇心”：温度、best-of-N、树搜索或 RAG 只能改变采样方式或条件，不会更新智能体对环境的认识。作者提出界定好奇心的框架，强调从交互中在线改进的环境预测、用预期改进指导行动，以及跨上下文窗口保留学习结果。","title":"Sampling Is Not Curiosity: Why LLM Agents Should Investigate"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_faf58236b331ffac5ab0cdc2acb63d4c41855c34dd9ed6b2677daf422a32e373","internal_url":"/posts/20261110-arxiv-on-agentic-manipulation-policies-0-e84d20698c/","observation_id":"obs_e84d20698cc7a671e7a864639f81f91bee039005171bf8245447f998da81dbf3","published_at":"2026-11-06T18:59:34Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这项研究提出智能体式操作策略（AMPs）：由通用 AI 模型直接操控机械臂，并根据任务进展动态调整动作。作者设计了可跨单臂、双臂和移动操作运行的 AMP1，在多项仿真基准及真实机器人测试中优于专家示范训练的策略。","title":"On Agentic Manipulation Policies"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_38d6712f4ea72a8c79da32ec543587a978bb1471972344bf22b348b4d4b4587d","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-github_trending-ccfos-nightingale-0-a9efcea186/","observation_id":"obs_a9efcea186a6d2c96a51047ed1422b195147b5acef8809afa904a1d91e532b6b","published_at":"2026-11-06T15:02:42Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"github_trending","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"ccfos / nightingale"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_dd1f052132a92b622a4f67c91d786c0ae120116df847b7bd47c0cb89a0dd47c6","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-github_trending-evil0ctal-douyin_tiktok_download_api-9-bc2884ba1b/","observation_id":"obs_bc2884ba1b1bfb5d6000f1382427ce9f71e49f10164ee7a8842e905ecba491df","published_at":"2026-11-06T00:15:05Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"github_trending","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"Evil0ctal / Douyin_TikTok_Download_API"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_d1fb334d50dabd2939a698e52348a32ed767b5af7ed03e4beb97c88eb661747a","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-blogs_podcasts-getting-started-with-web-answer-on-amazon-bedrock--0-614ec411e8/","observation_id":"obs_614ec411e822a540898f15e570bc65f7c99b1de4d8e763c931bcb2cccaf8f043","published_at":"2026-11-05T21:04:24Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的 Web Answer 现已正式可用。开发者只需调用一次工具，即可获得基于当前网页信息、由模型综合生成并附带来源链接的回答，无需自行搭建搜索、检索、内容清洗和引用提取流程。","title":"Getting started with Web Answer on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_68cee360942b7e8efa12f49664464d286d4222103c8afad6fa67d9b2060e61b1","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-arxiv-swarmevolve-latent-agent-swarms-for-evolutionary-d-0-6f7078b324/","observation_id":"obs_6f7078b324b1954466218c0ab514603989f805fdd1c106f8621d9fda98e8288f","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:59:29Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"SwarmEvolve 是一种利用大规模智能体群体进行进化式搜索的方法，让智能体在隐空间协作、共享 KV 缓存信息，并结合新颖性筛选与隐式交叉来生成和优化程序。实验显示，它在数学发现与科学计算任务上以更短时间取得了较高平均分。","title":"SwarmEvolve: Latent Agent Swarms for Evolutionary Discovery and Optimization"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_88a612f2b9d9e09fe85c32779b74d6a4a0ca737140afc675eb60eac1496e994b","internal_url":"/posts/20261107-arxiv-xstack-a-benchmark-for-ml-repo-migration-0-c506adad28/","observation_id":"obs_c506adad28825d2b4f3de3c5e292070bbd219fb1a6fa5dc04956dc9de5be67a4","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:55:54Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"XStack 是一个用于评估 AI 代理跨框架、跨硬件迁移机器学习代码仓库的基准。代理需要把 PyTorch 仓库迁移为可在 TPU 上运行的 JAX 仓库，并通过基于原仓库结果的校准评分。","title":"XStack: A Benchmark for ML Repo Migration"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_d9826a69ee6bd32f994d304dae3fc4640f1d9d54e6bf7c49de5340934fde7cc0","internal_url":"/posts/20261108-arxiv-reprobridge-building-reproducibility-into-ml-resea-2-5d920b8c07/","observation_id":"obs_5d920b8c0784633371b19f05fcbc35b545ad7b7b847e7f7676f28bda4f20be55","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:45:36Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"ReproBridge 将代码、环境配置、实验启动器和复现指南整合成标准化制品，并通过智能体工作流保存实验过程中的操作知识与决策。其目标是提升机器学习实验的独立复现成功率。","title":"ReproBridge: Building Reproducibility into ML Research Artifacts"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_268a9176bddcc441740e381c3ce10e121fbc6387dae6c8721dd94327fec0b5ec","internal_url":"/posts/20261109-arxiv-benchmarks-as-software-terminal-bench-and-the-case-5-554e91182f/","observation_id":"obs_554e91182f04f9cb418bf145542d289d389ae347adfd9a24d1840e1d67e62fa3","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:18:39Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这项工作提出“持续验证”流程，通过社区反馈、任务产物、代理轨迹、自动检查和人工审核，持续维护智能体基准。研究对 Terminal-Bench 2.0 的审计发现约 30% 的任务存在问题，修复后形成 2.1 版；结果准确率提高超过 10 个百分点，榜单名次最多变化三位。","title":"Benchmarks as Software: Terminal-Bench and the Case for Continuous Benchmarks"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_0d40ab33453c1ffd45f8b8479389ebf75d40c8739f45f4bca22caeb204d73530","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-blogs_podcasts-how-amazon-marketplace-evaluates-content-quality-w-1-fad370bb7b/","observation_id":"obs_fad370bb7b6d436415c6f4ddb8a02e1562eca0569d93ed1a33f1eed45345207d","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:06:43Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这篇文章介绍一种面向电商商品详情页的内容质量评估方案：用视觉语言模型理解整页图片、文字与布局的协同效果，再结合 OCR 可读性信号和 CatBoost 分类器，依据专家标注输出质量判断。方案还利用 SHAP 解释评分依据，并在 Amazon SageMaker AI 上覆盖数据接入、模型托管、监控等环节。","title":"How Amazon Marketplace evaluates content quality with Amazon SageMaker AI"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_f7af8e8908c3d041746c649e4d8687222e4358902c35f25088b969c77f2f795d","internal_url":"/posts/20260228-hacker_news-show-hn-sqlite-for-rivet-actors-one-database-per-a-9/","observation_id":"obs_335e94a0914635a16cbbdf38c0fd20694f0daa6e3b11930fd2fde7d5d4da4a42","published_at":"2026-11-05T17:17:42Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"Show HN: SQLite for Rivet Actors – one database per agent, tenant, or document"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_6946cf536ab340e76842588cd231fa56c3c087cc3499c2db340bd1952f46e8f6","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-arxiv-a-framework-for-context-enrichment-and-selective-r-0-1ba2bc1e63/","observation_id":"obs_1ba2bc1e6399e93d4fd435a7c22726067a41e0e5dc538d05675de7d9f0122609","published_at":"2026-11-04T18:58:23Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这篇论文研究如何通过有控制地补充提示上下文，减少大语言模型智能体在语义不变改写下行为的波动，同时保持对社会环境变化的合理响应。作者提出“上下文增强”和“选择性稳健性”框架，并在囚徒困境类博弈中进行了验证。","title":"A Framework for Context Enrichment and Selective Robustness in LLM Social Agents"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:AI Agent","id":"tag:AI Agent","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":13,"graph_node_id":"tag:大语言模型","id":"tag:大语言模型","jaccard":0.464286,"topic":"大语言模型"},{"cooccurrence":8,"graph_node_id":"tag:Prompt 工程","id":"tag:Prompt 工程","jaccard":0.285714,"topic":"Prompt 工程"},{"cooccurrence":8,"graph_node_id":"tag:机器学习","id":"tag:机器学习","jaccard":0.285714,"topic":"机器学习"},{"cooccurrence":4,"graph_node_id":"tag:生成式 AI","id":"tag:生成式 AI","jaccard":0.142857,"topic":"生成式 AI"},{"cooccurrence":3,"graph_node_id":"tag:Advanced (300)","id":"tag:Advanced (300)","jaccard":0.107143,"topic":"Advanced (300)"},{"cooccurrence":3,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock","id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock","jaccard":0.107143,"topic":"Amazon Bedrock"},{"cooccurrence":3,"graph_node_id":"tag:RAG","id":"tag:RAG","jaccard":0.107143,"topic":"RAG"},{"cooccurrence":3,"graph_node_id":"tag:Technical How-to","id":"tag:Technical How-to","jaccard":0.107143,"topic":"Technical How-to"},{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock AgentCore","id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock AgentCore","jaccard":0.071429,"topic":"Amazon Bedrock AgentCore"},{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:Announcements","id":"tag:Announcements","jaccard":0.071429,"topic":"Announcements"},{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:Expert (400)","id":"tag:Expert (400)","jaccard":0.071429,"topic":"Expert (400)"},{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:Foundational (100)","id":"tag:Foundational (100)","jaccard":0.071429,"topic":"Foundational (100)"}],"scenarios":[{"count":1,"name":"AI/ML项目"}],"schema_version":"stack_trends_topic_v2","sources":[{"count":11,"name":"arxiv"},{"count":10,"name":"blogs_podcasts"},{"count